      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "ワシはこの村に住んどる年寄りなんじゃが、\nありがたいことに孫娘が生まれてのう。\nそのお祝いの宴を開きたいんじゃ。\nたいした礼もできんが、舞い手を頼めんかのう？",
        "official_en": "I'm an elderly person living in this village, and I\nwant to celebrate the recent birth of my beautiful\ngranddaughter. I can't pay much, but would you\nsend a dancer for me?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "UNREVIEWED"
      }
    },
